      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village sprang up after the Boston & Albany Railroad opened a station in 1886, turning a forested area into a commuter suburb.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
