        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waban%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Waban Library Center, originally built in 1930, reopened in 2009 as a community hub run by the Waban Improvement Society.",
